      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory RTO Paperwork, Transit Marine Insurance &amp; Delivery Handover for Transport from Bangalore Hyderabad</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Transporting a vehicle from Bangalore to Hyderabad involves a few key documents that must be in order to ensure a smooth and compliant transfer. The most important paperwork includes a self‑attested RC photocopy, a current Pollution Under Control (PUC) certificate, a valid insurance certificate, and an IBA‑approved consignment bilty.</p>
<p>These items collectively prove ownership, compliance with environmental regulations, coverage against loss or damage, and legal acceptance of the consignment by the transport operator.</p>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Self‑attested RC Photocopy</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The Registration Certificate (RC) is the primary proof of ownership. A photocopy must be self‑attested by the vehicle owner, confirming that the copy is a true representation of the original document. This step prevents disputes over authenticity during the handover at the destination.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Current PUC Certificate</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The Pollution Under Control (PUC) certificate confirms that the vehicle meets the latest emission standards. Transporters require the latest certificate (usually valid for 12 months) to ensure the vehicle is road‑worthy and compliant with state regulations.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Valid Insurance Certificate</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The insurance policy should cover the vehicle for the entire duration of the transit. It must be valid on the date of departure and include coverage for third‑party liability, theft, and accidental damage.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #a855f722; color: #a855f7; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">04</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IBA‑Approved Consignment Bilty</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The International Bilty Association (IBA) consignment bilty is a standardized document that acts as a contract between the consignor and the carrier. It details the vehicle’s description, route, and terms of transport, and it must be signed by both parties.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p>One of the most critical aspects of vehicle transport is the marine transit insurance. A 100% declared‑value marine insurance policy guarantees that the insurer will pay the full declared value of the vehicle in the event of loss, damage, or theft during transit.</p>
<p>Unlike standard policies that offer a fixed sum insured, a declared‑value policy is tailored to the actual market value of the car, providing peace of mind that the full replacement cost will be covered. This type of insurance is especially important for high‑value or vintage vehicles where depreciation can significantly affect resale value.</p>

<p>In summary, ensure that the RC photocopy, PUC certificate, insurance policy, and IBA consignment bilty are all current and properly attested. Pair these documents with a 100% declared‑value marine transit insurance to safeguard your investment and comply with all regulatory requirements for moving a vehicle between Bangalore and Hyderabad.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


